  Can you please post this to the r-sig-mixed-models mailing list, or
as an issue on the glmmTMB issues list?  The README info on the
glmmTMB repository <https://github.com/glmmTMB/glmmTMB#glmmtmb>
specifies this "where to ask?" guide:

* r-sig-mix...@r-project.org for general questions about glmmTMB
usage and mixed models
* https://github.com/glmmTMB/glmmTMB/issues for bug, infelicity, and
wishlist reporting
* https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/tmb-users for TMB-specific questions

(short answer: the "false convergence" warning comes from R's nlminb
optimizer and is unfortunately rather hard to diagnose:
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/40039114/r-nlminb-what-does-false-convergence-actually-mean)

